msgstr "Blaze Riders : contournez les Shades et fauchez les Nightbolts."

#. const HINT_SPOTLIGHT_TOWER := "Not the tower."
#: scripts/campaign/mission_01.gd:32
msgid "Not the tower."
msgstr "Pas la tour."

#. [&"westwatch", "Westwatch", Vector3(-44.0, 0.0, -20.0), 8.0],
#: scripts/campaign/mission_01.gd:59
msgid "Westwatch"
msgstr "Westwatch"

#. [&"southgate", "Southgate", Vector3(22.0, 0.0, 44.0), 8.0],
#: scripts/campaign/mission_01.gd:60
msgid "Southgate"
msgstr "Southgate"

#. [&"narrator", "The Master is gone. His crown is not."],
#: scripts/campaign/mission_01.gd:99
msgid "The Master is gone. His crown is not."
msgstr "Le Maître est parti. Pas sa couronne."

#. [&"vessa", "An Ember Crown, in a place called Emberfall. Nobody said it was left for me. Nobody said it wasn't
#: scripts/campaign/mission_01.gd:100
msgid "An Ember Crown, in a place called Emberfall. Nobody said it was left for me. Nobody said it wasn't."
msgstr "Une Ember Crown, dans un lieu nommé Emberfall. Personne n'a dit qu'on l'a laissée pour moi. Personne n'a dit le contraire."

#. [&"vessa", "Three braziers, one seal. I've been lighting things since before I could talk."],
#: scripts/campaign/mission_01.gd:101
msgid "Three braziers, one seal. I've been lighting things since before I could talk."
msgstr "Trois braseros, un sceau. J'allume des choses depuis avant de savoir parler."

#. [&"malrik", "Little Vessa. You came a long way to lose something you never had."],
#: scripts/campaign/mission_01.gd:102
msgid "Little Vessa. You came a long way to lose something you never had."
msgstr "Petite Vessa. Tu viens de loin pour perdre ce que tu n'as jamais eu."

#. [&"vessa", "One lit. Malrik, you still dress like a funeral that got lost on the way."],
#: scripts/campaign/mission_01.gd:103
msgid "One lit. Malrik, you still dress like a funeral that got lost on the way."
msgstr "Un d'allumé. Malrik, tu t'habilles encore comme un enterrement égaré."

#. [&"pell", "Free at last! Buy something, would you? Shadow soldiers are terrible customers. They never pay, the
#: scripts/campaign/mission_01.gd:104
msgid "Free at last! Buy something, would you? Shadow soldiers are terrible customers. They never pay, they just loom."
msgstr "Enfin libre ! Achetez quelque chose, voulez-vous ? Les soldats de l'Ombre sont d'affreux clients. Ils ne paient jamais, ils rôdent."

#. [&"narrator", "The Westwatch fire rises. Riders who remember the old kingdom ride to meet it."],
#: scripts/campaign/mission_01.gd:105
msgid "The Westwatch fire rises. Riders who remember the old kingdom ride to meet it."
msgstr "Le feu de Westwatch s'élève. Des cavaliers qui se souviennent du vieux royaume accourent."

#. [&"malrik", "Light all the candles you like. The dark just gets a better view."],
#: scripts/campaign/mission_01.gd:106
msgid "Light all the candles you like. The dark just gets a better view."
msgstr "Allume toutes les bougies que tu veux. Le noir n'en voit que mieux."

#. [&"narrator", "Three flames answer. The seal cracks, and the old wardens wake up grumpy."],
#: scripts/campaign/mission_01.gd:107
msgid "Three flames answer. The seal cracks, and the old wardens wake up grumpy."
msgstr "Trois flammes répondent. Le sceau se fend, et les vieux gardiens se réveillent grognons."

#. [&"vessa", "I'm here for the crown, not a lecture. Fine. Both."],
#: scripts/campaign/mission_01.gd:108
msgid "I'm here for the crown, not a lecture. Fine. Both."
msgstr "Je viens pour la couronne, pas pour un sermon. Bon. Les deux."

#. [&"malrik", "Put it down. That crown was never meant for someone who throws fire at her problems."],
#: scripts/campaign/mission_01.gd:109
msgid "Put it down. That crown was never meant for someone who throws fire at her problems."
msgstr "Pose-la. Cette couronne n'a jamais été faite pour qui règle ses problèmes au feu."

#. [&"vessa", "Then it's in the right hands. I throw fire at ALL my problems."],
#: scripts/campaign/mission_01.gd:110
msgid "Then it's in the right hands. I throw fire at ALL my problems."
msgstr "Alors elle est en bonnes mains. Je règle TOUS mes problèmes au feu."

#. [&"malrik", "Keep it warm for me. The other three will come for it now."],
#: scripts/campaign/mission_01.gd:111
msgid "Keep it warm for me. The other three will come for it now."
msgstr "Garde-la au chaud pour moi. Les trois autres vont venir la chercher."

#. [&"narrator", "Far away, three apprentices feel the crown wake up, and begin to worry."],
#: scripts/campaign/mission_01.gd:112
msgid "Far away, three apprentices feel the crown wake up, and begin to worry."
msgstr "Au loin, trois apprentis sentent la couronne s'éveiller, et s'inquiètent."

#. [&"vessa", "Tell the others... I was winning."],
#: scripts/campaign/mission_01.gd:113
msgid "Tell the others... I was winning."
msgstr "Dites aux autres... que je gagnais."

#. "The God Wizard vanished between one breath and the next. He left four apprentices, four kingdoms and not one
#: scripts/campaign/mission_01.gd:116
msgid "The God Wizard vanished between one breath and the next. He left four apprentices, four kingdoms and not one word of instruction. His regalia fell across the world like sparks from a kicked fire."
msgstr "Le Dieu Sorcier a disparu entre deux souffles. Il a laissé quatre apprentis, quatre royaumes et pas un mot d'instruction. Ses regalia se sont dispersés sur le monde comme les étincelles d'un feu qu'on a renversé du pied."

#. "One spark still glows: the Ember Crown, sealed in Emberfall, the Master's burnt-out observatory on the border
#: scripts/campaign/mission_01.gd:117
msgid "One spark still glows: the Ember Crown, sealed in Emberfall, the Master's burnt-out observatory on the border between the Fire and Shadow kingdoms. Three old braziers hold the seal shut."
msgstr "Une étincelle brille encore : l'Ember Crown, scellée à Emberfall, l'observatoire calciné du Maître, à la frontière des royaumes du Feu et de l'Ombre. Trois vieux braseros tiennent le sceau fermé."

#. "Vessa, the youngest and least patient apprentice, rides out the night she hears of it. Malrik of Shadow got t
#: scripts/campaign/mission_01.gd:118
msgid "Vessa, the youngest and least patient apprentice, rides out the night she hears of it. Malrik of Shadow got there first and is camped at the far end of the ruins. He cannot light a brazier. She can."
msgstr "Vessa, la plus jeune et la moins patiente des apprentis, part la nuit même où elle l'apprend. Malrik de l'Ombre est arrivé le premier et campe au bout des ruines. Il ne peut pas allumer un brasero. Elle, si."

#. const HINT_START := "Walk Vessa with W A S D. Light the brazier to the north-east."
#: scripts/campaign/mission_01.gd:120
msgid "Walk Vessa with W A S D. Light the brazier to the north-east."
msgstr "Déplacez Vessa avec W A S D. Allumez le brasero au nord-est."

#. const HINT_FIRST_LIT := "Train more soldiers at the Ember Hall (Z / X)."
#: scripts/campaign/mission_01.gd:121
msgid "Train more soldiers at the Ember Hall (Z / X)."
msgstr "Formez plus de soldats à l'Ember Hall (Z / X)."

#. const HINT_STRONGHOLD := "Your Keep can become a Stronghold: select the Keep and press %s (%d crystals). It op
#: scripts/campaign/mission_01.gd:128 scripts/campaign/mission_02.gd:142
#: scripts/campaign/mission_03.gd:150
msgid "Your Keep can become a Stronghold: select the Keep and press %s (%d crystals). It opens %s."
msgstr "Votre Donjon peut devenir une Forteresse : sélectionnez le Donjon et appuyez sur %s (%d cristaux). Débloque : %s."

#. const MSG_SEALED_M1 := "The seal holds. Light the three braziers of Emberfall."
#: scripts/campaign/mission_01.gd:130
msgid "The seal holds. Light the three braziers of Emberfall."
msgstr "Le sceau tient. Allumez les trois braseros d'Emberfall."

#. const MSG_MALRIK_FELL := "Malrik has fallen back into the shadows"
#: scripts/campaign/mission_01.gd:131 scripts/campaign/mission_02.gd:193
#: scripts/campaign/mission_03.gd:226 scripts/campaign/mission_04.gd:144
