msgstr "Charred Glade"

#. &"S3": ["Greenhold ruins", Vector3(43.0, 0.0, 43.0), [["shade", 3], ["nightbolt", 2], ["rimeshield", 1],
#: scripts/campaign/mission_e2_01.gd:62
msgid "Greenhold ruins"
msgstr "les ruines de Greenhold"

#. [&"narrator", "The Sighing Wood kept out of every quarrel for a century. Now it is ash, and the ash is frozen.
#: scripts/campaign/mission_e2_01.gd:163
msgid "The Sighing Wood kept out of every quarrel for a century. Now it is ash, and the ash is frozen."
msgstr "Le Sighing Wood est resté à l'écart de toutes les querelles pendant un siècle. Le voilà en cendres, et la cendre a gelé."

#. [&"vessa", "Fire AND frost. They didn't just burn it. They made sure it stayed dead."],
#: scripts/campaign/mission_e2_01.gd:164
msgid "Fire AND frost. They didn't just burn it. They made sure it stayed dead."
msgstr "Le feu ET le givre. Ils ne l'ont pas juste brûlé. Ils se sont assurés qu'il reste mort."

#. [&"messenger", "The Heartwood is past the old tree. She's inside it."],
#: scripts/campaign/mission_e2_01.gd:165
msgid "The Heartwood is past the old tree. She's inside it."
msgstr "Le Heartwood est derrière le vieil arbre. Elle est dedans."

#. [&"vey", "I'll ride the north road and see what Torvald brought. Light the beacon when you want the storm."],
#: scripts/campaign/mission_e2_01.gd:166
msgid "I'll ride the north road and see what Torvald brought. Light the beacon when you want the storm."
msgstr "Je prends la route du nord voir ce que Torvald a amené. Allume le fanal quand tu voudras l'orage."

#. [&"vessa", "You just got back, and you're leaving again? You're lucky I'm busy."],
#: scripts/campaign/mission_e2_01.gd:167
msgid "You just got back, and you're leaving again? You're lucky I'm busy."
msgstr "Tu viens de revenir et tu repars déjà ? T'es chanceux que je sois occupée."

#. [&"vessa", "Shades in the ashes. Malrik never could resist a funeral."],
#: scripts/campaign/mission_e2_01.gd:168
msgid "Shades in the ashes. Malrik never could resist a funeral."
msgstr "Des Shades dans les cendres. Malrik n'a jamais pu résister à un enterrement."

#. [&"ashby", "Shadow at the camp, my queen! We'll hold the hall. Go!"],
#: scripts/campaign/mission_e2_01.gd:169
msgid "Shadow at the camp, my queen! We'll hold the hall. Go!"
msgstr "L'Ombre attaque le camp, ma reine ! On tient la salle. Allez !"

#. [&"aldra", "Hold the rime. When the green stops beating, the wood is ours."],
#: scripts/campaign/mission_e2_01.gd:170
msgid "Hold the rime. When the green stops beating, the wood is ours."
msgstr "Tenez le givre. Quand le vert cessera de battre, le bois sera à nous."

#. [&"torvald", "So the little ember comes to warm the wood. You are late, child. Winter got here first."],
#: scripts/campaign/mission_e2_01.gd:171
msgid "So the little ember comes to warm the wood. You are late, child. Winter got here first."
msgstr "Alors la petite braise vient réchauffer le bois. Tu arrives trop tard, petite. L'hiver est passé avant toi."

#. [&"aldra", "Cracked. Not broken. Torvald will hear of this."],
#: scripts/campaign/mission_e2_01.gd:172
msgid "Cracked. Not broken. Torvald will hear of this."
msgstr "Fissuré. Pas brisé. Torvald en entendra parler."

#. [&"vessa", "You always said fire was the problem, Ysolde. Today it's the answer."],
#: scripts/campaign/mission_e2_01.gd:173
msgid "You always said fire was the problem, Ysolde. Today it's the answer."
msgstr "Tu as toujours dit que le feu était le problème, Ysolde. Aujourd'hui, c'est la réponse."

#. [&"messenger", "The roots are warm again!"],
#: scripts/campaign/mission_e2_01.gd:174
msgid "The roots are warm again!"
msgstr "Les racines sont chaudes à nouveau !"

#. [&"malrik", "Vessa. Have you noticed whose side the winter is on now?"],
#: scripts/campaign/mission_e2_01.gd:175
msgid "Vessa. Have you noticed whose side the winter is on now?"
msgstr "Vessa. As-tu remarqué de quel côté se range l'hiver, maintenant ?"

#. [&"vessa", "Two of you, one of me. Sounds fair. For me."],
#: scripts/campaign/mission_e2_01.gd:176
msgid "Two of you, one of me. Sounds fair. For me."
msgstr "Vous deux, moi toute seule. Ça me semble équitable. Pour moi."

#. [&"torvald", "I told Malrik no, once. Then I watched you carry three keys toward the Hollow."],
#: scripts/campaign/mission_e2_01.gd:177
msgid "I told Malrik no, once. Then I watched you carry three keys toward the Hollow."
msgstr "J'ai dit non à Malrik, une fois. Puis je t'ai vue porter trois clés vers le Hollow."

#. [&"vessa", "So you picked the man who sends knives at night. Great judgement, Torvald."],
#: scripts/campaign/mission_e2_01.gd:178
msgid "So you picked the man who sends knives at night. Great judgement, Torvald."
msgstr "Alors tu as choisi l'homme qui envoie des couteaux la nuit. Beau jugement, Torvald."

#. [&"vessa", "The beacon's lit. Vey! You said call. I'm calling!"],
#: scripts/campaign/mission_e2_01.gd:179
msgid "The beacon's lit. Vey! You said call. I'm calling!"
msgstr "Le fanal est allumé. Vey ! Tu as dit d'appeler. J'appelle !"

#. [&"vessa", "Twelve years late, then twelve hours. You're improving."],
#: scripts/campaign/mission_e2_01.gd:180
msgid "Twelve years late, then twelve hours. You're improving."
msgstr "Douze ans de retard, puis douze heures. Tu t'améliores."

#. [&"vey", "The spark first. Then the storm!"],
#: scripts/campaign/mission_e2_01.gd:181 scripts/campaign/mission_e3_04.gd:136
msgid "The spark first. Then the storm!"
msgstr "L'étincelle d'abord. Puis l'orage !"

#. [&"messenger", "You're alive! Go south, follow the red banners!"],
#: scripts/campaign/mission_e2_01.gd:182
msgid "You're alive! Go south, follow the red banners!"
msgstr "Vous êtes vivants ! Allez au sud, suivez les bannières rouges !"

#. [&"messenger", "That's everyone who could still walk."],
#: scripts/campaign/mission_e2_01.gd:183
msgid "That's everyone who could still walk."
msgstr "C'est tous ceux qui pouvaient encore marcher."

#. [&"vessa", "That's one hall Torvald won't need to keep cold any more."],
#: scripts/campaign/mission_e2_01.gd:184
msgid "That's one hall Torvald won't need to keep cold any more."
msgstr "Voilà une salle que Torvald n'aura plus besoin de garder au froid."

#. [&"narrator", "Shadow from the east, frost from the north. The two new friends close the vice."],
#: scripts/campaign/mission_e2_01.gd:185
msgid "Shadow from the east, frost from the north. The two new friends close the vice."
msgstr "L'Ombre à l'est, le givre au nord. Les deux nouveaux amis referment l'étau."

#. [&"torvald", "Now, Bishop. Before the spring remembers itself."],
#: scripts/campaign/mission_e2_01.gd:186
msgid "Now, Bishop. Before the spring remembers itself."
msgstr "Maintenant, Évêque. Avant que le printemps se souvienne de lui-même."

#. [&"messenger", "The heart's slowing! Please don't let it stop!"],
#: scripts/campaign/mission_e2_01.gd:187
msgid "The heart's slowing! Please don't let it stop!"
msgstr "Le cœur ralentit ! Je vous en prie, ne le laissez pas s'arrêter !"

#. [&"torvald", "Spring is stubborn. So is winter. This is not over, child."],
#: scripts/campaign/mission_e2_01.gd:188
msgid "Spring is stubborn. So is winter. This is not over, child."
msgstr "Le printemps est têtu. L'hiver aussi. Ce n'est pas fini, petite."

#. [&"ysolde", "You came. I told you to remember. I didn't think you'd listen."],
#: scripts/campaign/mission_e2_01.gd:189
msgid "You came. I told you to remember. I didn't think you'd listen."
msgstr "Tu es venue. Je t'avais dit de te souvenir. Je ne pensais pas que tu écouterais."

#. [&"vessa", "I never listen. I just show up."],
#: scripts/campaign/mission_e2_01.gd:190
msgid "I never listen. I just show up."
msgstr "Je n'écoute jamais. Je me présente, c'est tout."

#. [&"aldra", "The green has stopped. Winter keeps this wood now."],
#: scripts/campaign/mission_e2_01.gd:191
msgid "The green has stopped. Winter keeps this wood now."
msgstr "Le vert s'est arrêté. L'hiver garde ce bois, désormais."

#. [&"vessa", "Ysolde... I came. I really came..."],
#: scripts/campaign/mission_e2_01.gd:192
msgid "Ysolde... I came. I really came..."
msgstr "Ysolde... Je suis venue. Je suis vraiment venue..."

#. [&"messenger", "No. It's gone cold."],
#: scripts/campaign/mission_e2_01.gd:193
msgid "No. It's gone cold."
msgstr "Non. Il est devenu froid."

#. "The feast ended at midnight. By first light the Emberguard was on the road north, and by noon it reached the
#: scripts/campaign/mission_e2_01.gd:196
msgid "The feast ended at midnight. By first light the Emberguard was on the road north, and by noon it reached the Sighing Wood, or what is left of it: black trunks under white frost, ash that crunches like snow."
msgstr "Le festin a pris fin à minuit. À l'aube, l'Emberguard était sur la route du nord, et à midi elle atteignait le Sighing Wood, ou ce qu'il en reste : des troncs noirs sous un givre blanc, une cendre qui craque comme de la neige."

#. "Shadow burned the wood and Ice froze the ashes so nothing could grow back. Wren says one heart still beats: t
#: scripts/campaign/mission_e2_01.gd:197
msgid "Shadow burned the wood and Ice froze the ashes so nothing could grow back. Wren says one heart still beats: the Last Heartwood, beside the dead Oldroot, where Ysolde fell back with her final wardens. Torvald's frost is creeping over it."
msgstr "L'Ombre a brûlé le bois et la Glace a gelé les cendres pour que rien ne repousse. Wren dit qu'un cœur bat encore : le Last Heartwood, près de l'Oldroot mort, où Ysolde s'est repliée avec ses derniers gardiens. Le givre de Torvald gagne du terrain sur lui."

#. "Malrik and Torvald hold the north of the wood, one camp each. Two wizards against one. Vessa has never been g
#: scripts/campaign/mission_e2_01.gd:198
msgid "Malrik and Torvald hold the north of the wood, one camp each. Two wizards against one. Vessa has never been good at arithmetic, and she is not about to start."
msgstr "Malrik et Torvald tiennent le nord du bois, un camp chacun. Deux sorciers contre une. Vessa n'a jamais été bonne en calcul, et elle ne compte pas commencer aujourd'hui."

#. const BRIEFING_FROST_LINE := "Torvald's frost is creeping over the Heartwood. Reach it before it stops beating
#: scripts/campaign/mission_e2_01.gd:200
msgid "Torvald's frost is creeping over the Heartwood. Reach it before it stops beating."
msgstr "Le givre de Torvald gagne le Heartwood. Rejoignez-le avant qu'il cesse de battre."

#. const HINT_START := "Reach the Heartwood past the dead oak. Clear the glade, then hold Vessa beside it to kind
#: scripts/campaign/mission_e2_01.gd:201
msgid "Reach the Heartwood past the dead oak. Clear the glade, then hold Vessa beside it to kindle it."
msgstr "Rejoignez le Heartwood derrière le chêne mort. Nettoyez la clairière, puis gardez Vessa près de lui pour le raviver."

#. const HINT_FOLK := "Wren knows where the survivors hide (green pings). Free them and they walk to your keep."
#: scripts/campaign/mission_e2_01.gd:202
msgid "Wren knows where the survivors hide (green pings). Free them and they walk to your keep."
msgstr "Wren sait où se cachent les survivants (signaux sur la carte). Libérez-les et ils marcheront jusqu'à votre donjon."

#. const HINT_HOLD := "Hold the glade. Shadow comes from the north-east, Ice from the north-west."
#: scripts/campaign/mission_e2_01.gd:203
msgid "Hold the glade. Shadow comes from the north-east, Ice from the north-west."
msgstr "Tenez la clairière. L'Ombre arrive du nord-est, la Glace du nord-ouest."

#. const HINT_CITADEL := "Your Stronghold can become a Citadel: select the Keep and press X (300 crystals, 90 s).
#: scripts/campaign/mission_e2_01.gd:204 scripts/campaign/mission_e2_02.gd:236
#: scripts/campaign/mission_e2_03.gd:158
msgid "Your Stronghold can become a Citadel: select the Keep and press X (300 crystals, 90 s). It opens the Ashveil Saboteur (C) and lets you call Old Vey (V)."
msgstr "Votre Forteresse peut devenir une Citadelle : sélectionnez le Donjon et appuyez sur X (300 cristaux, 90 s). Elle débloque l'Ashveil Saboteur (C) et permet d'appeler Old Vey (V)."

#. const HINT_CALL := "Call Old Vey: select the Keep and press V. He fights on his own; his card sets where (Esco
#: scripts/campaign/mission_e2_01.gd:205 scripts/campaign/mission_e2_02.gd:237
#: scripts/campaign/mission_e2_03.gd:159
msgid "Call Old Vey: select the Keep and press V. He fights on his own; his card sets where (Escort / Vanguard / Hold home)."
msgstr "Appelez Old Vey : sélectionnez le Donjon et appuyez sur V. Il se bat seul ; sa carte décide où (Escorte / Avant-garde / Garder la base)."

#. const MSG_KINDLE_BLOCKED := "Clear the glade first: the roots won't open while the enemy stands in it"
#: scripts/campaign/mission_e2_01.gd:206 scripts/campaign/mission_e4_03.gd:167
#: scripts/campaign/mission_e4_04.gd:179
msgid "Clear the glade first: the roots won't open while the enemy stands in it"
msgstr "Nettoyez d'abord la clairière : les racines ne s'ouvriront pas tant que l'ennemi s'y trouve"

#. const MSG_FROST_HALF := "The frost has taken half the Heartwood"
#: scripts/campaign/mission_e2_01.gd:207
msgid "The frost has taken half the Heartwood"
msgstr "Le givre a pris la moitié du Heartwood"

#. const MSG_FROST_80 := "The Heartwood is almost frozen"
#: scripts/campaign/mission_e2_01.gd:208
msgid "The Heartwood is almost frozen"
msgstr "Le Heartwood est presque gelé"

#. const MSG_TORVALD_FELL := "Torvald has fallen, the frost will bring him back"
#: scripts/campaign/mission_e2_01.gd:210 scripts/campaign/mission_e2_02.gd:244
#: scripts/campaign/mission_e2_05.gd:235 scripts/campaign/mission_e4_03.gd:168
#: scripts/campaign/mission_e4_04.gd:175 scripts/world/skirmish.gd:298
msgid "Torvald has fallen, the frost will bring him back"
msgstr "Torvald est tombé, le givre le ramènera"

