#. return "Carry the sunshard to the Door"
#: scripts/campaign/mission_e2_05.gd:1006
msgid "Carry the sunshard to the Door"
msgstr "Portez l'éclat de soleil à la Porte"

#. return "Carry sunshards from the lit Sunstones to the Door: each one makes it strike"
#: scripts/campaign/mission_e2_05.gd:1007
msgid "Carry sunshards from the lit Sunstones to the Door: each one makes it strike"
msgstr "Portez des éclats de soleil des Pierres solaires allumées jusqu'à la Porte : chacun la fait frapper"

#. return "Sunfoot must stand"
#: scripts/campaign/mission_e2_05.gd:1011
msgid "Sunfoot must stand"
msgstr "Sunfoot doit tenir"

#. return "All four seals white-gold when the jailer wakes"
#: scripts/campaign/mission_e2_05.gd:1013
msgid "All four seals white-gold when the jailer wakes"
msgstr "Les quatre sceaux d'or blanc au réveil du geôlier"

#. return "Keep the Door above half its light"
#: scripts/campaign/mission_e2_05.gd:1015
msgid "Keep the Door above half its light"
msgstr "Gardez la Porte au-dessus de la moitié de sa lumière"

#. return "Raise a Cinder Dragon"
#: scripts/campaign/mission_e2_05.gd:1017
msgid "Raise a Cinder Dragon"
msgstr "Élevez un dragon de cendre"

#. const MISSION_TITLE := "Take the Ford"
#: scripts/campaign/mission_e3_01.gd:26
msgid "Take the Ford"
msgstr "Prendre le gué"

#. const STANDARDS := {&"std_clover": ["Clover Stone", Vector3(-28.0, 0.0, 20.0)],
#: scripts/campaign/mission_e3_01.gd:80
msgid "Clover Stone"
msgstr "Pierre du Trèfle"

#. &"std_ysolde": ["Ysolde's Standard", Vector3(1.5, 0.0, 21.5)], &"std_well": ["Lark Well", Vector3(24.0, 0.0, 1
#: scripts/campaign/mission_e3_01.gd:81
msgid "Ysolde's Standard"
msgstr "Étendard d'Ysolde"

#. &"std_ysolde": ["Ysolde's Standard", Vector3(1.5, 0.0, 21.5)], &"std_well": ["Lark Well", Vector3(24.0, 0.0, 1
#: scripts/campaign/mission_e3_01.gd:81
msgid "Lark Well"
msgstr "Puits de l'Alouette"

#. [&"narrator", "Evenmead. The last green country. By sundown, someone will own the ford."],
#: scripts/campaign/mission_e3_01.gd:151
msgid "Evenmead. The last green country. By sundown, someone will own the ford."
msgstr "Evenmead. Le dernier pays vert. Au coucher du soleil, quelqu'un tiendra le gué."

#. [&"malrik", "Torvald, the east bank is yours. I will take the water. Hush, take whatever moves."],
#: scripts/campaign/mission_e3_01.gd:152
msgid "Torvald, the east bank is yours. I will take the water. Hush, take whatever moves."
msgstr "Torvald, la rive est est à toi. Je prends l'eau. Hush, prends tout ce qui bouge."

#. [&"hush", "Whatever moves, Bishop. And a few things that don't."],
#: scripts/campaign/mission_e3_01.gd:153
msgid "Whatever moves, Bishop. And a few things that don't."
msgstr "Tout ce qui bouge, Évêque. Et quelques choses qui ne bougent pas."

#. [&"torvald", "Quickly, then. Before that stone in your pocket finishes its sentence."],
#: scripts/campaign/mission_e3_01.gd:154
msgid "Quickly, then. Before that stone in your pocket finishes its sentence."
msgstr "Vite, alors. Avant que cette pierre dans ta poche finisse sa phrase."

#. [&"obren", "So much green, Bishop. Let it grow red. I can help."],
#: scripts/campaign/mission_e3_01.gd:155
msgid "So much green, Bishop. Let it grow red. I can help."
msgstr "Tant de vert, Évêque. Laisse-le rougir. Je peux t'aider."

#. [&"malrik", "You can help by being quiet. Stones are usually good at that."],
#: scripts/campaign/mission_e3_01.gd:156
msgid "You can help by being quiet. Stones are usually good at that."
msgstr "Tu peux m'aider en te taisant. D'habitude, les pierres sont douées pour ça."

#. [&"vessa", "Malrik! You brought a whole winter to a picnic."],
#: scripts/campaign/mission_e3_01.gd:157
msgid "Malrik! You brought a whole winter to a picnic."
msgstr "Malrik ! Tu as amené un hiver complet à un pique-nique."

#. [&"malrik", "And you brought fire to a meadow. We all have our gifts, Vessa."],
#: scripts/campaign/mission_e3_01.gd:158
msgid "And you brought fire to a meadow. We all have our gifts, Vessa."
msgstr "Et toi, du feu dans une prairie. Chacun ses talents, Vessa."

#. [&"ysolde", "That water is older than all four of us. Get out of it."],
#: scripts/campaign/mission_e3_01.gd:159
msgid "That water is older than all four of us. Get out of it."
msgstr "Cette eau est plus vieille que nous quatre. Sors de là."

#. [&"malrik", "The ford is mine. Write it down, Ysolde. You like things that last."],
#: scripts/campaign/mission_e3_01.gd:160
msgid "The ford is mine. Write it down, Ysolde. You like things that last."
msgstr "Le gué est à moi. Écris-le, Ysolde. Tu aimes les choses qui durent."

#. [&"narrator", "Across the river, the Lark horns call the whole valley to arms."],
#: scripts/campaign/mission_e3_01.gd:161
msgid "Across the river, the Lark horns call the whole valley to arms."
msgstr "De l'autre côté de la rivière, les cors de l'Alouette appellent toute la vallée aux armes."

#. [&"hush", "One horn fewer. The valley will have to shout."],
#: scripts/campaign/mission_e3_01.gd:162
msgid "One horn fewer. The valley will have to shout."
msgstr "Un cor de moins. La vallée devra crier."

#. [&"vessa", "He's on our hill. I'm not waiting for him to plant a flag."],
#: scripts/campaign/mission_e3_01.gd:163
msgid "He's on our hill. I'm not waiting for him to plant a flag."
msgstr "Il est sur notre colline. Je n'attendrai pas qu'il y plante un drapeau."

#. [&"ysolde", "Vessa, hold the crest. Please. Just once, wait."],
#: scripts/campaign/mission_e3_01.gd:164
msgid "Vessa, hold the crest. Please. Just once, wait."
msgstr "Vessa, tiens la crête. S'il te plaît. Juste une fois, attends."

#. [&"obren", "The flag falls. The tree is right there. Take it. TAKE it."],
#: scripts/campaign/mission_e3_01.gd:165
msgid "The flag falls. The tree is right there. Take it. TAKE it."
msgstr "Le drapeau tombe. L'arbre est juste là. Prends-le. PRENDS-LE."

#. [&"torvald", "Malrik. Your hand is shaking. Is that you, or the stone?"],
#: scripts/campaign/mission_e3_01.gd:166
msgid "Malrik. Your hand is shaking. Is that you, or the stone?"
msgstr "Malrik. Ta main tremble. C'est toi, ou la pierre ?"

#. [&"malrik", "It is me, Torvald. It has always been me."],
#: scripts/campaign/mission_e3_01.gd:167
msgid "It is me, Torvald. It has always been me."
msgstr "C'est moi, Torvald. Ça a toujours été moi."

#. [&"ysolde", "Every root on this hill knows your name now. That is not a kindness."],
#: scripts/campaign/mission_e3_01.gd:168
msgid "Every root on this hill knows your name now. That is not a kindness."
msgstr "Chaque racine de cette colline connaît ton nom, maintenant. Ce n'est pas une faveur."

#. [&"hush", "There is always another night."],
#: scripts/campaign/mission_e3_01.gd:169
msgid "There is always another night."
msgstr "Il y a toujours une autre nuit."

#. [&"vessa", "This isn't over, candle-man!"],
#: scripts/campaign/mission_e3_01.gd:170
msgid "This isn't over, candle-man!"
msgstr "Ce n'est pas fini, l'homme à la chandelle !"

#. [&"malrik", "It never is. That is what I like about you."],
#: scripts/campaign/mission_e3_01.gd:171
msgid "It never is. That is what I like about you."
msgstr "Ça ne l'est jamais. C'est ce que j'aime chez toi."

#. [&"malrik", "The ford is mine. The tree is not. Not today."],
#: scripts/campaign/mission_e3_01.gd:172
msgid "The ford is mine. The tree is not. Not today."
msgstr "Le gué est à moi. L'arbre, non. Pas aujourd'hui."

#. [&"malrik", "Tell me to stop again tomorrow, Ysolde. I will not stop."],
#: scripts/campaign/mission_e3_01.gd:173
msgid "Tell me to stop again tomorrow, Ysolde. I will not stop."
msgstr "Dis-moi encore d'arrêter demain, Ysolde. Je n'arrêterai pas."

#. [&"narrator", "The ford fell at dusk. The golden tree still stood. Both hills called it a victory."],
#: scripts/campaign/mission_e3_01.gd:174
msgid "The ford fell at dusk. The golden tree still stood. Both hills called it a victory."
msgstr "Le gué est tombé au crépuscule. L'arbre doré tenait toujours. Les deux collines ont crié victoire."

#. [&"malrik", "Not like this. Not... stopped."],
#: scripts/campaign/mission_e3_01.gd:175
msgid "Not like this. Not... stopped."
msgstr "Pas comme ça. Pas... arrêté."

#. "This spring the Master's door held, and the war came up out of the deep looking for open ground. It found Eve
#: scripts/campaign/mission_e3_01.gd:178
msgid "This spring the Master's door held, and the war came up out of the deep looking for open ground. It found Evenmead: knee-high flowers, one slow river, two hills, and the Master's golden tree on the far one."
msgstr "Ce printemps, la porte du Maître a tenu, et la guerre est remontée des profondeurs en quête de terrain découvert. Elle a trouvé Evenmead : des fleurs jusqu'aux genoux, une rivière lente, deux collines, et l'arbre doré du Maître sur la plus lointaine."

#. "Malrik holds the north ridge with Torvald's winter at his side. On Lark Hill wait Ysolde, who has nothing lef
#: scripts/campaign/mission_e3_01.gd:179
msgid "Malrik holds the north ridge with Torvald's winter at his side. On Lark Hill wait Ysolde, who has nothing left but this valley, and Vessa, who never waits for anything. Between them runs the river, and one stone ford."
msgstr "Malrik tient la crête nord, l'hiver de Torvald à ses côtés. Sur Lark Hill attendent Ysolde, à qui il ne reste que cette vallée, et Vessa, qui n'attend jamais rien. Entre eux coule la rivière, et un gué de pierre."

#. "Take the ford. Then take the foot of their hill, and let them watch from the top. In Malrik's pocket, Obren's
#: scripts/campaign/mission_e3_01.gd:180
msgid "Take the ford. Then take the foot of their hill, and let them watch from the top. In Malrik's pocket, Obren's heart-stone beats, and whispers to him."
msgstr "Prenez le gué. Puis prenez le pied de leur colline, et laissez-les regarder d'en haut. Dans la poche de Malrik, la pierre-cœur d'Obren bat, et elle lui murmure des choses."

#. const HINT_START := "Take the Stone Ford, due south. Fords slow every unit inside: win the fight on the bank,
#: scripts/campaign/mission_e3_01.gd:182
msgid "Take the Stone Ford, due south. Fords slow every unit inside: win the fight on the bank, then cross."
msgstr "Prenez le Stone Ford, plein sud. Les gués ralentissent toute unité qui s'y trouve : gagnez le combat sur la rive, puis traversez."

