msgstr "Gatereeds"

#. const SPEAKER_NAMES := {&"vessa": "Vessa", &"ashby": "Sergeant Ashby", &"gannet": "Gannet Rook", &"narrator":
#: scripts/campaign/mission_e5_02.gd:119 scripts/campaign/mission_e5_02.gd:259
msgid "Sergeant Ashby"
msgstr "Sergent Ashby"

#. [&"narrator", "Three summers on, the reivers built a fort in the fens. Vessa was sent to knock."],
#: scripts/campaign/mission_e5_02.gd:124 data/voice/lines/e5m2.json:L1
msgid "Three summers on, the reivers built a fort in the fens. Vessa was sent to knock."
msgstr "Trois étés plus tard, les pillards ont bâti un fort dans les marais. On a envoyé Vessa cogner à la porte."

#. [&"ashby", "Sergeant Ashby, my lady. Vey says I'm to keep you alive. He says it's a full-time job."],
#: scripts/campaign/mission_e5_02.gd:125 data/voice/lines/e5m2.json:L2
msgid "Sergeant Ashby, my lady. Vey says I'm to keep you alive. He says it's a full-time job."
msgstr "Sergent Ashby, ma dame. Vey dit que je dois vous garder en vie. Il dit que c'est un emploi à temps plein."

#. [&"vessa", "Vey worries. I've been practising. Give me a wall and I'll burn a door through it."],
#: scripts/campaign/mission_e5_02.gd:126 data/voice/lines/e5m2.json:L3
msgid "Vey worries. I've been practising. Give me a wall and I'll burn a door through it."
msgstr "Vey s'inquiète. Je me suis pratiquée. Donne-moi un mur, et j'y brûlerai une porte."

#. [&"ashby", "Yes, my lady. With the army, my lady. The army's the bit that walks behind you."],
#: scripts/campaign/mission_e5_02.gd:127 data/voice/lines/e5m2.json:L4
msgid "Yes, my lady. With the army, my lady. The army's the bit that walks behind you."
msgstr "Oui, ma dame. Avec l'armée, ma dame. L'armée, c'est la partie qui marche derrière vous."

#. [&"ashby", "Reeds, my lady. Lovely place to hide a knife. Let the lads go in first."],
#: scripts/campaign/mission_e5_02.gd:128 data/voice/lines/e5m2.json:L5
msgid "Reeds, my lady. Lovely place to hide a knife. Let the lads go in first."
msgstr "Des roseaux, ma dame. Belle place pour cacher un couteau. Laissez les gars passer en premier."

#. [&"gannet", "Little match! Three years, and you still run in alone!"],
#: scripts/campaign/mission_e5_02.gd:129 data/voice/lines/e5m2.json:L6
msgid "Little match! Three years, and you still run in alone!"
msgstr "Petite allumette ! Trois ans, et tu fonces encore toute seule !"

#. [&"vessa", "Okay. OKAY. Bad idea. Very bad idea!"],
#: scripts/campaign/mission_e5_02.gd:130 data/voice/lines/e5m2.json:L7
msgid "Okay. OKAY. Bad idea. Very bad idea!"
msgstr "OK. OK ! Mauvaise idée. Très mauvaise idée !"

#. [&"ashby", "There! In the reeds! That's what waiting buys you, my lady."],
#: scripts/campaign/mission_e5_02.gd:131 data/voice/lines/e5m2.json:L8
msgid "There! In the reeds! That's what waiting buys you, my lady."
msgstr "Là ! Dans les roseaux ! Voilà ce que ça rapporte, d'attendre, ma dame."

#. [&"gannet", "Burn my tents, would you? I'll have your diggers and their shovels too."],
#: scripts/campaign/mission_e5_02.gd:132 data/voice/lines/e5m2.json:L9
msgid "Burn my tents, would you? I'll have your diggers and their shovels too."
msgstr "Tu brûles mes tentes, hein ? Je vais prendre tes creuseurs, et leurs pelles avec."

#. [&"ashby", "Hurlers! Now we're talking. They throw farther than those towers can shoot."],
#: scripts/campaign/mission_e5_02.gd:133 data/voice/lines/e5m2.json:L10
msgid "Hurlers! Now we're talking. They throw farther than those towers can shoot."
msgstr "Des lanceurs ! Là, on se parle. Ils lancent plus loin que ces tours peuvent tirer."

#. [&"gannet", "Come on, match! Come and knock! I'm right here! Just you!"],
#: scripts/campaign/mission_e5_02.gd:134 data/voice/lines/e5m2.json:L11
msgid "Come on, match! Come and knock! I'm right here! Just you!"
msgstr "Viens, l'allumette ! Viens cogner ! Je suis juste ici ! Toi toute seule !"

#. [&"vessa", "One tower down! Ashby, did you see? Write it down somewhere!"],
#: scripts/campaign/mission_e5_02.gd:135 data/voice/lines/e5m2.json:L12
msgid "One tower down! Ashby, did you see? Write it down somewhere!"
msgstr "Une tour de moins ! Ashby, t'as vu ? Écris-le quelque part !"

#. [&"gannet", "Out, boys! Knock the fire-throwers flat!"],
#: scripts/campaign/mission_e5_02.gd:136 data/voice/lines/e5m2.json:L13
msgid "Out, boys! Knock the fire-throwers flat!"
msgstr "Dehors, les gars ! Aplatissez-moi ces lanceurs de feu !"

#. [&"vessa", "See? A door! I said there'd be a door!"],
#: scripts/campaign/mission_e5_02.gd:137 data/voice/lines/e5m2.json:L14
msgid "See? A door! I said there'd be a door!"
msgstr "Tu vois ? Une porte ! J'avais dit qu'il y aurait une porte !"

#. [&"ashby", "There already was a door, my lady. It had a latch."],
#: scripts/campaign/mission_e5_02.gd:138 data/voice/lines/e5m2.json:L15
msgid "There already was a door, my lady. It had a latch."
msgstr "Il y avait déjà une porte, ma dame. Elle avait un loquet."

#. [&"ashby", "You're glowing, my lady. More than usual, I mean."],
#: scripts/campaign/mission_e5_02.gd:139 data/voice/lines/e5m2.json:L16
msgid "You're glowing, my lady. More than usual, I mean."
msgstr "Vous brillez, ma dame. Plus que d'habitude, je veux dire."

#. [&"gannet", "My nest! My lovely nest! The horn, boys! Blow the horn!"],
#: scripts/campaign/mission_e5_02.gd:140 data/voice/lines/e5m2.json:L17
msgid "My nest! My lovely nest! The horn, boys! Blow the horn!"
msgstr "Mon nid ! Mon beau nid ! Le cor, les gars ! Sonnez le cor !"

#. [&"gannet", "Keep the fort! Keep the fens! I'm keeping my neck!"],
#: scripts/campaign/mission_e5_02.gd:141 data/voice/lines/e5m2.json:L18
msgid "Keep the fort! Keep the fens! I'm keeping my neck!"
msgstr "Gardez le fort ! Gardez les marais ! Moi, je garde ma peau !"

#. [&"narrator", "Rookhold burned until morning. So, by accident, did the grain it had stolen."],
#: scripts/campaign/mission_e5_02.gd:142 data/voice/lines/e5m2.json:L19
msgid "Rookhold burned until morning. So, by accident, did the grain it had stolen."
msgstr "Rookhold a brûlé jusqu'au matin. Et, par accident, le grain qu'il avait volé aussi."

#. [&"vessa", "Ashby. That was the grain. That was the grain we came here to take back."],
#: scripts/campaign/mission_e5_02.gd:143 data/voice/lines/e5m2.json:L20
msgid "Ashby. That was the grain. That was the grain we came here to take back."
msgstr "Ashby. C'était le grain. Le grain qu'on était venus reprendre."

#. [&"ashby", "It was, my lady. It's toast now. Very good toast."],
#: scripts/campaign/mission_e5_02.gd:144 data/voice/lines/e5m2.json:L21
msgid "It was, my lady. It's toast now. Very good toast."
msgstr "Oui, ma dame. C'est des toasts, maintenant. De très bons toasts."

#. [&"vessa", "The Master's going to say it. I know he is. \"Fire that will not wait...\""],
#: scripts/campaign/mission_e5_02.gd:145 data/voice/lines/e5m2.json:L22
msgid "The Master's going to say it. I know he is. \"Fire that will not wait...\""
msgstr "Le Maître va le dire. Je le sais. « Le feu qui n'attend pas... »"

#. [&"ashby", "\"...burns its own house.\" Yes, my lady. We've all heard him say it."],
#: scripts/campaign/mission_e5_02.gd:146 data/voice/lines/e5m2.json:L23
msgid "\"...burns its own house.\" Yes, my lady. We've all heard him say it."
msgstr "« ...brûle sa propre maison. » Oui, ma dame. On l'a tous entendu le dire."

#. [&"ashby", "Just a scratch! Carry on, my lady, I'll catch you up!"],
#: scripts/campaign/mission_e5_02.gd:147 data/voice/lines/e5m2.json:L24
msgid "Just a scratch! Carry on, my lady, I'll catch you up!"
msgstr "Juste une égratignure ! Continuez, ma dame, je vous rattrape !"

#. [&"vessa", "I should have... waited..."],
#: scripts/campaign/mission_e5_02.gd:148 data/voice/lines/e5m2.json:L25
msgid "I should have... waited..."
msgstr "J'aurais dû... attendre..."

#. "Winter, the truce. Vessa laughs at something nobody else heard. Ashby, grey now, knows exactly which day she
#: scripts/campaign/mission_e5_02.gd:151
msgid "Winter, the truce. Vessa laughs at something nobody else heard. Ashby, grey now, knows exactly which day she means."
msgstr "L'hiver, la trêve. Vessa rit de quelque chose que personne d'autre n'a entendu. Ashby, grisonnant maintenant, sait exactement à quel jour elle pense."

#. "Three summers after the Vale of Bells, Gannet Rook was back: a fort of black timber in the southern fens, Roo
#: scripts/campaign/mission_e5_02.gd:152
msgid "Three summers after the Vale of Bells, Gannet Rook was back: a fort of black timber in the southern fens, Rookhold, and in it the grain of half the south border. The Master sent his youngest apprentice to fetch it back."
msgstr "Trois étés après le val des Cloches, Gannet Rook était de retour : un fort de bois noir dans les marais du sud, Rookhold, et dedans le grain de la moitié de la frontière sud. Le maître envoya sa plus jeune apprentie le reprendre."

#. "Vessa was fifteen. She had an army, a sergeant called Ashby, and one piece of advice from Vey: wait for your
#: scripts/campaign/mission_e5_02.gd:153
msgid "Vessa was fifteen. She had an army, a sergeant called Ashby, and one piece of advice from Vey: wait for your soldiers. She was sure she would remember it."
msgstr "Vessa avait quinze ans. Elle avait une armée, un sergent nommé Ashby, et un seul conseil de Vey : attends tes soldats. Elle était certaine de s'en souvenir."

#. const BRIEFING_BOYS := "The miller's boys from the Vale of Bells, three years older, march with her."
#: scripts/campaign/mission_e5_02.gd:155
msgid "The miller's boys from the Vale of Bells, three years older, march with her."
msgstr "Les fils du meunier du val des Cloches, trois ans plus vieux, marchent avec elle."

#. const HINT_START := "Rookhold is south-east. The Causeway is short but runs through the reeds. The Long Dyke g
#: scripts/campaign/mission_e5_02.gd:156
msgid "Rookhold is south-east. The Causeway is short but runs through the reeds. The Long Dyke goes round."
msgstr "Rookhold est au sud-est. La chaussée est courte, mais traverse les roseaux. La longue digue fait le tour."

#. const HINT_REEDS := "Reeds hide ambushes. Send soldiers in first, or walk Vessa in with at least 4 of them."
#: scripts/campaign/mission_e5_02.gd:157
msgid "Reeds hide ambushes. Send soldiers in first, or walk Vessa in with at least 4 of them."
msgstr "Les roseaux cachent des embuscades. Envoyez d'abord des soldats, ou entrez avec Vessa et au moins 4 d'entre eux."

#. const HINT_SHOP := "Shop: walk Vessa within 12 m of the camp or the Ember Hall and press T."
#: scripts/campaign/mission_e5_02.gd:158
