#. "They came by four roads, and for one evening they stood on the same hill: fire, shadow, ice and green. Nobody
#: scripts/campaign/mission_e8_02.gd:65
msgid "They came by four roads, and for one evening they stood on the same hill: fire, shadow, ice and green. Nobody drew a blade. Old Vey said it was the first miracle he had seen in thirty years."
