msgstr "jambe droite"

#. "The four keys turned, and Crown Hollow fell in on itself. Out of the dust climbed the last thing Obren ever b
#: scripts/campaign/mission_e8_03.gd:67
msgid "The four keys turned, and Crown Hollow fell in on itself. Out of the dust climbed the last thing Obren ever built: a king of rubble eighteen metres tall, with the Hollow Throne for a heart and four chains of light dragging at his limbs."
msgstr "Les quatre clés ont tourné, et Crown Hollow s'est effondré sur lui-même. De la poussière est sortie la dernière chose qu'Obren ait bâtie : un roi de décombres haut de dix-huit mètres, le Trône du Hollow pour cœur et quatre chaînes de lumière tirant sur ses membres."

#. "The chains hold only while the keyholes hold. Every time the four pull together, the King is bound and can be
#: scripts/campaign/mission_e8_03.gd:68
msgid "The chains hold only while the keyholes hold. Every time the four pull together, the King is bound and can be hurt. Let one keyhole weaken and the chains go slack; let two fall at once and he is free."
msgstr "Les chaînes tiennent seulement tant que les serrures tiennent. Chaque fois que les quatre tirent ensemble, le Roi est lié et peut être blessé. Qu'une serrure faiblisse et les chaînes se relâchent ; que deux tombent en même temps, et il est libre."

#. "Somewhere under the pit, a white-gold light is climbing toward the surface. The Master is coming up. Hold the
#: scripts/campaign/mission_e8_03.gd:69
msgid "Somewhere under the pit, a white-gold light is climbing toward the surface. The Master is coming up. Hold the King until he gets there, and then, all four of you, turn the keys together."
msgstr "Quelque part sous la fosse, une lumière d'or blanc monte vers la surface. Le Maître remonte. Retenez le Roi jusqu'à son arrivée, puis, tous les quatre, tournez les clés ensemble."

#. const BRIEFING_LINE := "Every death near the King feeds him."
#: scripts/campaign/mission_e8_03.gd:71
msgid "Every death near the King feeds him."
msgstr "Chaque mort près du Roi le nourrit."

#. const HINT_START := "The King climbs for 4:30. Hold your keyhole. When the chains pull together, strike."
#: scripts/campaign/mission_e8_03.gd:72
msgid "The King climbs for 4:30. Hold your keyhole. When the chains pull together, strike."
msgstr "Le Roi grimpe pendant 4:30. Tenez votre serrure. Quand les chaînes tirent ensemble, frappez."

#. const HINT_TOGETHER := "All four stand at your keyholes. Keep your helper beside you: the Hollow Pulse breaks
#: scripts/campaign/mission_e8_03.gd:73
msgid "All four stand at your keyholes. Keep your helper beside you: the Hollow Pulse breaks the turn unless every helper grounds it."
msgstr "Tous les quatre à vos serrures. Gardez votre assistant près de vous : la Pulsation du Hollow brise le tour à moins que chaque assistant ne la détourne."

#. const MSG_SURGE := "The chains pull! Strike now!"
#: scripts/campaign/mission_e8_03.gd:74
msgid "The chains pull! Strike now!"
msgstr "Les chaînes tirent ! Frappez maintenant !"

#. const MSG_WAITING := "The chains wait: the {kingdom} keyhole is below half"
#: scripts/campaign/mission_e8_03.gd:75
msgid "The chains wait: the {kingdom} keyhole is below half"
msgstr "Les chaînes attendent : la serrure {kingdom} est sous la moitié"

#. const MSG_BROKEN := "The {kingdom} chain is broken! The King's {limb} is free!"
#: scripts/campaign/mission_e8_03.gd:76
msgid "The {kingdom} chain is broken! The King's {limb} is free!"
msgstr "La chaîne {kingdom} est brisée ! Le {limb} du Roi est libre !"

#. const MSG_STAGGER := "The King staggers!"
#: scripts/campaign/mission_e8_03.gd:77
msgid "The King staggers!"
msgstr "Le Roi chancelle !"

#. const MSG_OPEN := "The King is open!"
#: scripts/campaign/mission_e8_03.gd:78
msgid "The King is open!"
msgstr "Le Roi est à découvert !"

#. const MSG_WARD_LOW := "The {kingdom} Key-Ward is at {pct} %!"
#: scripts/campaign/mission_e8_03.gd:79
msgid "The {kingdom} Key-Ward is at {pct} %!"
msgstr "La Garde-clé {kingdom} est à {pct} % !"

#. const MSG_MENDED := "The {kingdom} Key-Ward is mended."
#: scripts/campaign/mission_e8_03.gd:80
msgid "The {kingdom} Key-Ward is mended."
msgstr "La Garde-clé {kingdom} est réparée."

#. const HINT_MEND := "Ward Mend: stand beside a Key-Ward with your wizard, no Host near, for 3 s (+25 %, every 6
#: scripts/campaign/mission_e8_03.gd:81
msgid "Ward Mend: stand beside a Key-Ward with your wizard, no Host near, for 3 s (+25 %, every 60 s). It relights a broken one."
msgstr "Réparation de garde : placez votre sorcier près d'une Garde-clé, sans l'Ost à proximité, pendant 3 s (+25 %, toutes les 60 s). Elle rallume une garde brisée."

#. c.victory_banner = "VICTORY\nThe King falls"
#: scripts/campaign/mission_e8_03.gd:144
msgid "VICTORY\nThe King falls"
msgstr "VICTOIRE\nLe Roi tombe"

